{"id":"a5ba2702c21f0a09","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-balanced.md","title":"Balanced","display":"df-balanced — Balanced","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-balanced","aliases":["58-df-balanced"],"display":"df-balanced — Balanced","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-balanced"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-balanced</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-balanced — Balanced"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S(\\mathbb K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K})\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S(\\mathbb K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K})\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(E,+_E,\\odot)\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(E,+_E,\\odot)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq E\">\\(B\\subseteq E\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Balanced}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Balanced}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}balanced} \\vdash \\mathrm{Balanced}_S(B,E,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\left(B\\subseteq E\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(\\mathbb K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K})\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(E,+_E,\\odot)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\left(|\\lambda|\\leq1\\to\\{\\lambda\\odot b\\mid b\\in B\\}\\subseteq B\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}balanced} \\vdash \\mathrm{Balanced}_S(B,E,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\left(B\\subseteq E\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(\\mathbb K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K})\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(E,+_E,\\odot)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\left(|\\lambda|\\leq1\\to\\{\\lambda\\odot b\\mid b\\in B\\}\\subseteq B\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Balanced sets are stable under scalar multiplication by scalars of norm at most one.</li>\n<li>标量作用在假设、谓词参数和闭包条件中统一为同一个运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot\">\\(\\odot\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\lambda|\">\\(|\\lambda|\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span> 的标准绝对值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}$ 且 $\\mathrm{Field}_S(\\mathbb K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K})$（see [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(E,+_E,\\odot)$（see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S(\\mathbb K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(E,+_E,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Balanced}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}balanced} \\vdash \\mathrm{Balanced}_S(B,E,\\mathbb K,+_E,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\left(B\\subseteq E\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(\\mathbb K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K})\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(E,+_E,\\odot)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\left(|\\lambda|\\leq1\\to\\{\\lambda\\odot b\\mid b\\in B\\}\\subseteq B\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\odot","display":false},{"tex":"|\\lambda|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C","display":false}],"bytes":12